say So you want a fight, $n?
~
#30013
* death
say Avenge me!
~
#30014
* surr: someone surrenders to it
say I accept your surrender, $n.
~
#30015
* random
emote looks around.
~
#30016
* entry: it walks into a room
emote strides in.
~
